# Harvested Comments and anything derived from them. This repo is public: the
# text is public on the Platform, but an archive of it paired with handles, or
# carrying per-person labels like HELP_REQUEST, is a different artifact and is
# not published from here. The scripts that read it are committed; the data is
# not. See tools/prepare_corpus.py.
data/
